Hello 3D ADEPT team,

an editorial lead on a design decision rather than a feature list.

Solidon3D reads downloaded 3D models and makes their features editable without
CAD knowledge. Click a hole and its dimensions appear on the model, type a new
diameter and the countersink follows, pick a fit for the screw, read the check
report before you export, hand the file to the slicer you already use. Two
boundaries in the product may be worth a paragraph.

The first is bounded recognition. The software shows only what a printer can
actually produce: features below the resolution of the process are not listed.
On a downloaded hose holder that removes several hundred entries from the
object tree that were measurement noise. The point is not the number. It is
that a tool of this kind has to decide what it does not say, or the result is
an inventory nobody can use.

The second is bounded AI. There is an assistant, it drives the same operations
the menus do, and it is entirely optional: every function works without it, it
can be switched off, and it can run locally on the user's own GPU rather than
in a service. Nothing is sent anywhere by default, and after a single
activation the application runs fully offline, with no account and no
telemetry.

The release itself, briefly: with 0.5.0 an imported mesh becomes an exact
body. Holes, countersinks and threads stay exact through moving, duplicating
and removing, and STEP round-trips cleanly. The options that used to switch
between the mesh and the exact kernel have been removed. A honeycomb pattern
or knurl is now one feature with pitch, cell width and depth instead of
hundreds of faces. Resin printers are supported.

Why this matters for your readers: there was no good way to adapt a downloaded
part until now. CAD packages accept an STL but cannot grip triangles, the mesh
tools that could edit them are discontinued, and parametric customisers only
work when the original author anticipated the parameter.

Interface and manual are in six languages. The demo is free and complete, so
any of the above can be checked directly.

